  Mode: 92
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Starweave
  Description: 'Brittle Stars only - a timed weaving war. Creation Mode lays a trail from every corner
    of your ring, five at once, at half speed. Everything you leave standing is score, and
    every rival''s guns, cords and ring are aimed at it. Mass crystals fatten your weave;
    Space crystals lengthen your guns for a raid. The team with the most volume standing
    when the clock runs out wins. Higher intensities scatter fewer crystals and start every
    hull with longer guns.'
